    "title": "Lesson 5: Tools to Define Your Purpose",
    "content_type": "text",
    "content": "<h2>Objective</h2><p>Craft a personal purpose statement.</p><h3>Key Ideas</h3><ul><li>Anecdote: Fisherman & Merchant.</li><li>Success Afrika techniques; passions & strengths; values alignment.</li></ul><h3>Activity</h3><p>Draft your purpose statement and get peer feedback.</p>",
