    "title": "Lesson 6: Purpose in Action",
    "content_type": "text",
    "content": "<h2>Objective</h2><p>Integrate purpose into daily living.</p><h3>Key Ideas</h3><ul><li>Proverb: “The child who is not embraced by the village…”</li><li>Purposeful habits; time management; African exemplars.</li></ul><h3>Activity</h3><p>Create a weekly schedule aligned with your purpose.</p>",
