    "title": "Lesson 7: Sharing & Sustaining Your Purpose",
    "content_type": "text",
    "content": "<h2>Objective</h2><p>Inspire others and sustain momentum.</p><h3>Key Ideas</h3><ul><li>Clay Lamp story; Zig Ziglar’s ‘help others get what they want’.</li><li>Ongoing growth via Success Afrika and other resources.</li></ul><h3>Activity</h3><p>Design a small community project that reflects your purpose.</p>",
